"P1983120350" "I shall have that costume as a trophy."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2074743481" "Time for a battle."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1880711047" "You cannot compete with me."
