// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P4262979657" "You are my new favorite hero."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P522724726" "Maybe I was wrong about capes."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
