// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P420710259" "It would be unfortunate for anything untoward to happen to your property."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1275872879" "You want Tsoo protection, don't you?"
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
