// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1078999340" "Thanks. They would have ruined my business."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1071471884" "This town needs more heroes like you."

// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2739819953" "Finally, a chance to test my training."
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P114904265" "You will suffer for your insolence!"
// SHAKEDOWN_STORE_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1969719621" "You would do well to mind your own affairs."

