"P2390511997" "At last, a real fight."
// DARKASTORIA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2705914401" "Our victory will be glorious!"

// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1938933279" "Move like water!"
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2342158704" "Show them the power of the Tsoo."
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P421492068" "Remember your training."
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2083258961" "Swift and sure.  No hesitation."

// RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3589639548" "More challengers seek defeat."
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1251836609" "Be victorious."
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2740996194" "We will annihilate all our enemies!"

// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1910377892" "The Tsoo collect the taxes around here."
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P974538758" "I do hope you're not holding out."
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2380858409" "You would be wise to pay promptly."

// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P173857913" "You will feel my fury!"
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2665114728" "You are nothing to the Tsoo!"
// SHAKEDOWN_THREATENER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2532727136" "Are you ready to die?"

// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1705006489" "Please, I can't pay any more."
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P553756892" "You already took all I had."
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3777810148" "I'll get the money. Just don't hurt me!"

// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1405393776" "I don't know how to repay you!"
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1361993055" "You saved my life!"
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2460365439" "They would have taken every cent from me!"
// SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1907570807" "Those Tsoo are a menace!"

// SHAKEDOWN_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P15406091" "Do not interfere!"
// SHAKEDOWN_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P149745540" "This is none of your affair!"
// SHAKEDOWN_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2945851584" "We will manage these streets!"

// RELICSNATCH_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4215839828" "Surrender it to me."
// RELICSNATCH_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1114846409" "Give it up, or I will take it!"
// RELICSNATCH_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2816513338" "I assure you, that relic means more to me than your life."

// RELICSNATCH_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2343651958" "You can't steal from the Tsoo!"
// RELICSNATCH_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P606445211" "Fool! You will not cost me my prize!"
// RELICSNATCH_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3775486485" "You want it for yourself? Try and take it!"

// RELICSNATCH_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P3268534670" "I shudder to think what the Tsoo would have done with this relic."
// RELICSNATCH_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1656143126" "You just stopped the Tsoo from gaining great power!"
// RELICSNATCH_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1551637871" "If he had taken this, the results would have been catastrophic!"

// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2589064286" "Don't let them surprise you."
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1153290507" "Remember to focus your attacks."
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2786346443" "Anticipate, assess, react."

// RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3566891509" "To the kill!"
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3822133984" "Fight well, and you shall be rewarded."
// RUMBLE_ORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1889345976" "Dispose of this menace immediately."

// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3571878547" "I have anything your heart desires."
// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1337366626" "I have the finest wares and the best prices."
// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2298639067" "You can't find a better dealer in town."

// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1409822788" "Never interrupt a business negotiation!"
// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P270646927" "I won't be jailed for this!"
// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3058436200" "You'll never arrest me!"

// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1395721877" "I want a better deal."
// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1517100270" "I'm looking for something very special."
// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1102859922" "I don't know. Let me see some more."

// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P481192337" "You don't belong here!"
// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P784630162" "You will surely fall!"
// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2714349174" "You may have seen us, but you'll never report it!"

// STEEL_ALLHOODS_WALL_LEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3573062632" "I see my patience has granted me a gift."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_WALL_LEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1927130011" "Ah, so it is you."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_WALL_LEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2499612205" "You will will be an excellent opportunity to hone my skills."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_WALL_LEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1076393987" "Your misfortune is my luck."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_WALL_LEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4193360126" "Today is an excellent day to make you bleed."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P851382325" "You will fall!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2040108397" "You have been chosen for destruction by the Tsoo!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NIGHTPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2508787028" "This way!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NIGHTPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P399686236" "I found one!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NIGHTPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P929856463" "The hero's here!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_NIGHTPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1331192501" "Got him!"

