// DARKASTORIA_TSOO_NERVOUS_TALK2 :
"P2845649376" "Tub Ci was right..."
// DARKASTORIA_TSOO_NERVOUS_TALK2 :
"P677543542" "I wish we knew what we were looking for."
// DARKASTORIA_TSOO_NERVOUS_TALK2 :
"P951070552" "So much evil..."
// DARKASTORIA_TSOO_NERVOUS_TALK2 :
"P1007535619" "I came here to serve the cause... I wish I could leave."

// DARKASTORIA_TSOO_INVESTIGATION_INACTIVE :
"P337151061" "Another fiend slain.  If only its death could yield some clues."
// DARKASTORIA_TSOO_INVESTIGATION_INACTIVE :
"P2738958535" "Another lackey slain... if only we could find the beasts controlling them."
// DARKASTORIA_TSOO_INVESTIGATION_INACTIVE :
"P2374966490" "Such foul magic... I'm not sure I want to understand."

// DARKASTORIA_TSOO_GENERIC_ACTIVE :
"P903229823" "You are too late to do anything but die, interloper!"
// DARKASTORIA_TSOO_GENERIC_ACTIVE :
"P3475586967" "Where you before?! Now, you can die!"
// DARKASTORIA_TSOO_GENERIC_ACTIVE :
"P2149391578" "You have no place here!"

// DARKASTORIA_KOV_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P498322514" "Misguided servants of twisted deities! You are the same as all the others!"
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2563820746" "You could have found wisdom, instead you chose madness!"
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P199376961" "The path is clear and you stand in our way. The outcome is certain."

// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P19892213" "Do not act as saviors now! We know of your stained and tainted past!"
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3245035797" "It is too late for redemption!"
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1984446616" "Your puerile attempts to waylay the plans of the Furies will only lead you to oblivion!"

// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1304065278" "More fools to judge! More fools to kill!"
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4294690250" "The legion of the wicked shall never overwhelm our resolve!"
// DARKASTORIA_KOV_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P568793688" "You cannot stop us, though you can die trying!"

// DARKASTORIA_COT_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1741163799" "This time, when we kill you, you will stay dead!"
// DARKASTORIA_COT_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3787868616" "There are no more victims for you to infest... no place to go but oblivion."
// DARKASTORIA_COT_VERSUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3962006267" "Our enmity will not be forgotten, not even here, not ever!"

// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2880628928" "At the end of the world, is it possible to place all of this aside?"
// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1496017014" "We will fight you if we must!"
// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1428683279" "So much has been lost, but not our pride! We will now be cowed by you!"

// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1764398690" "If this must be, I will kill you."
// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2296372566" "The moment of death envelopes us both!"
// DARKASTORIA_COT_DEFEND_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P545623889" "Our defeat may be inevitable, but not to you!"

// DARKASTORIA_OUTNUMBER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3713966417" "What to do with a stray knife that's lost its purpose..."
// DARKASTORIA_OUTNUMBER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2913553235" "You shall be destroyed so that you may do no further harm!"
// DARKASTORIA_OUTNUMBER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P115713221" "For your role in this we have no forgiveness."

// DARKASTORIA_OUTNUMBER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3583335899" "The odds have shifted!"
// DARKASTORIA_OUTNUMBER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1305954488" "Kill them all! Quick, before she escapes!"
// DARKASTORIA_OUTNUMBER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P518059968" "We will stop you all! We will triumph!"

